{"v":4,"catch":"夢魘般的怪物，就潛藏在現實的境界裡……","desc":"《天蛾人1966》是互動式冒險 Pixel Pulps 新系列的第一款作品。由小說家Nico Saraintaris 執筆，Fernando Martinez Ruppel 擔任插畫的 Pixel Pulps 系列，是融合了融合了傑出文筆和美麗插畫，並受到20世紀中期的美式庸俗小說與80年代家用電腦遊戲畫面風格所啟發。首發系列由本作《天蛾人1966》、《Varney Lake》與《Bahnsen Knights》等三款遊戲所構成。","publisher":"Chorus Worldwide Games","release":"2022-07-14","genres":["冒險","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f76259a7e5ff092aba4cd679bbbd13c00fea564e23b79f2a235125c2486cab8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef6a7db3e98e141da2f1bd0b11f3225dd5dab68fc4a47162be5a926b3a750312.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1dc0f802558ff7c3ab9e4e6aa94f9f1c2292b1ba52bcc9b887f371893c771ed7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/469ed8b65642859e3f0a23e89652caddb1ccc193ff9129a948e038d271b619c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f957596b246582994df8731e8952e11ab559073fbd64c193c4cb0b85fbbd64b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf467109fdf61776aa6deaa38a2a980603303e3bd905f5d39bbeb183bb9281a5.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d04017ff0000","dlc":[]}